# XPhishGuard AI — Threat Intelligence API Configurations
# =======================================================
# Copy this file to '.env' and fill in your keys.

# 1. VirusTotal API Key (Required for live VirusTotal queries)
# Register for a free account at: https://www.virustotal.com/
# Go to your profile -> "API key" tab to copy your key.
VT_API_KEY=your_virustotal_api_key_here

# 2. PhishTank API Key (Optional, registered app key to prevent rate limiting)
# Register an account at: https://www.phishtank.com/
# Go to "Register Application" to obtain an app key.
PHISHTANK_API_KEY=your_phishtank_api_key_here
